  "summary": "Malicious code in @or-sdk/views (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (node setup.mjs) downloads the Bun runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases/download/bun-v1.3.13/ and uses it to execute a bundled 727KB obfuscated payload (math_init.js). The payload is obfuscated with a large encoded string array and a custom decoder. The package also depends on sibling packages (@or-sdk/base, @or-sdk/data-hub-svc, @or-sdk/tags) that are part of the same malicious campaign. Installing this package executes the obfuscated payload at install time.",
